{"resourceIdentifier":"3562","resourceName":"Agroforestry plantations in India","description":"This project is anagroforestry plantation initiated by ShivbhadraAgro Private LTD. with the help of local farmers. Plantation activities conducted at multiple locations of Gujarat, Maharashtra and Madhya Pradesh states of India from 2018. Farmers retain ownership of the trees, products, and land as well. Farmers received training from project implementer for plantation. Simple tree plantation technique is used with negligible soil disturbance. The proposed ARR VCS project plans to promote sustainable agroforestry for small-scale farmers to provide them with financial benefits and ensure GHG mitigation in the state of Gujarat, Maharastra and Madhya Pradesh India.","location":{"latitude":24.622590,"longitude":71.567390},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-08","endExclusive":"2022-12-09","endInclusive":"2022-12-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3562"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Gujarat, Maharashtra, Madhya Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shivbhadra Agro Private LTD"},{"type":"string","value":"Gujrat, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3562"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3562"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"8947"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":8867}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE